{"id": "dev000-ja", "item_id": "dev000", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["740"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法で「婚姻の届出の受理」を定めているのは**第740条**です。\n\n**第740条**：婚姻の届出は、法律（民法）や他の法令に違反していない限り、婚姻の届出を受理し、婚姻を成立させるものとします。\n\nつまり、法律に違反しない婚姻の届出は、受理されて婚姻が成立するという基本的な規定です。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["740"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2128, "tokens_out": 144, "tokens": 2272, "latency_s": 9.673057666999739, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 889, "out": 54, "ms": 3503.695166000398}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1239, "out": 90, "ms": 6162.9692950009485}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "婚姻の届出の受理", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev000-en", "item_id": "dev000", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["740"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第七百四十条が「婚姻の届出の受理」を定めています。同条は、婚姻の届出が関連する法令（禁止事由や届出期間など）に違反しないことを認めた後でなければ、婚姻の届出を受理できないと定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["740"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3515, "tokens_out": 155, "tokens": 3670, "latency_s": 10.913099190000139, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 887, "out": 54, "ms": 3733.705882999857}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1237, "out": 40, "ms": 2336.427836000439}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1391, "out": 61, "ms": 4838.398699999743}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "婚姻の届出の受理", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "740"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev001-ja", "item_id": "dev001", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["1003"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法における「負担付遺贈の受遺者の免責」を定めている条文は、**民法第923条**です。\n\n**内容の要約：**\n負担付遺贈の受遺者は、遺贈された財産の価額を限度としてのみ、遺言者が課した負担を履行する義務を負うとされています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["923"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["923"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 893, "tokens_out": 75, "tokens": 968, "latency_s": 5.87683104899952, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 75, "ms": 5875.211840000702}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev001-en", "item_id": "dev001", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["1003"], "anchor": [], "answer": "The article is **民法 第千二条 (Article 1002 of the Civil Code)**.\n\nIt provides that a beneficiary of a legacy subject to a burden is liable to fulfill the burden only to the extent that the value of the legacy exceeds the burden. If the beneficiary renounces the legacy, they are exempt from liability.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["1002"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["1002"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2162, "tokens_out": 128, "tokens": 2290, "latency_s": 8.77268464699955, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 891, "out": 58, "ms": 3693.1280169992533}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1271, "out": 70, "ms": 5075.798031999511}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "負担付遺贈の受遺者の免責", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev002-ja", "item_id": "dev002", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["987"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法において「受遺者に対する遺贈の承認又は放棄の催告」を定めているのは、**民法第973条**です。\n\n**内容の要約：**\n遺贈を受けた者（受遺者）が、遺贈の承認または放棄をしない場合、遺言執行者や他の遺贈受遺者などが、その受遺者に対して催告を行うことができます。この催告は、受遺者が一定の期間内に意思表示をしなければならないことを通知するものです。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["973"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["973"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 895, "tokens_out": 102, "tokens": 997, "latency_s": 5.963769766000041, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 895, "out": 102, "ms": 5961.525030001212}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev002-en", "item_id": "dev002", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["987"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**民法 第九百八十七条** (Article 987 of the Civil Code) deals with the demand for acceptance or renunciation of a legacy by a legatee.\n\nIt provides that the legatee's obligor (or other interested parties) may demand from the legatee, within a reasonable period, that they indicate whether they accept or renounce the legacy. If the legatee does not express their intention within that period, it is deemed that they have accepted the legacy.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["987"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3617, "tokens_out": 188, "tokens": 3805, "latency_s": 12.31128195600104, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 48, "ms": 3899.073517000943}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1265, "out": 40, "ms": 2591.977672000212}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1459, "out": 100, "ms": 5813.393222000741}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受遺者に対する遺贈の承認又は放棄の催告", "law": "民法"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "987"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev003-ja", "item_id": "dev003", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["395"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第395条が「抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予」を定めています。\n\n要約：抵当権の目的である建物を賃貸借により使用・収益する者は、競売の買受人が建物を取得した日から6ヶ月間は、買受人に引き渡す義務を負いません。ただし、使用開始が買受人の取得後である場合や、相当な期間の催告に応じない場合はこの限りではありません。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["395"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3655, "tokens_out": 195, "tokens": 3850, "latency_s": 13.822318616999837, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 58, "ms": 4812.805685000058}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1238, "out": 40, "ms": 2988.5013670009357}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1524, "out": 97, "ms": 6015.789111999766}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "395"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev003-en", "item_id": "dev003", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["395"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**Article 395 of the Civil Code** deals with「抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予」(Deferral of delivery to a user of a mortgaged building).\n\nIt provides that a user of a mortgaged building who holds a lease that cannot be opposed to the mortgagee is not required to deliver the building to the purchaser at the auction until six months have passed from the time of the purchaser's acceptance. Exceptions apply if the user started using the building after the auction or if the user fails to pay rent within a reasonable period after demand.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["395"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3649, "tokens_out": 217, "tokens": 3866, "latency_s": 14.32801384099912, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 891, "out": 58, "ms": 3486.6473649999534}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1236, "out": 40, "ms": 2426.0198829997535}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1522, "out": 119, "ms": 8410.415944001215}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "395"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev004-ja", "item_id": "dev004", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["264-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法で「管理不全土地管理命令」を定めている主な条文は以下の通りです。\n\n*   **第264条の9**: 裁判所が、所有者による土地の管理が不適当で他人の権利を侵害する恐れがある場合などに、管理不全土地管理命令を出すことを定めています。\n*   **第264条の10**: 管理不全土地管理人が、命令の対象となった土地や動産の管理・処分などの権限を有することを定めています。\n*   **第264条の11**: 管理不全土地管理人が、善良な管理者の注意をもって権限を行使しなければならない義務を定めています。\n*   **第264条の12**: 管理人が任務に違反して損害を与えた場合など、裁判所がその解任を命じることを定めています。\n*   **第264条の13**: 管理人が裁判所が定める額の費用の前払及び報酬を受けることができることを定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["264-9", "264-10", "264-11", "264-12", "264-13"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["264-10", "264-11", "264-12", "264-13"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2140, "tokens_out": 267, "tokens": 2407, "latency_s": 17.2345400109989, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 888, "out": 53, "ms": 3342.680981999365}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1252, "out": 214, "ms": 13888.277313999424}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "管理不全土地管理命令", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev004-en", "item_id": "dev004", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["264-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "The article dealing with「管理不全土地管理命令」is **Article 264-9 of the Civil Code** (民法 第二百六十四条の九).\n\nIt provides that when a landowner's management of land is inappropriate and infringes or threatens to infringe upon another's rights or legally protected interests, the court may issue a management order for the land (管理不全土地管理命令) to appoint a manager to handle the land.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["264-9"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2136, "tokens_out": 145, "tokens": 2281, "latency_s": 9.19381605200033, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 886, "out": 53, "ms": 3172.171335998428}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1250, "out": 92, "ms": 6018.376019001153}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "管理不全土地管理命令", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
