{"id": "dev005-en", "item_id": "dev005", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["413"], "anchor": [], "answer": "The term「受領遅滞」(delay in acceptance) is not a single statutory term but a legal concept primarily defined by **Article 412** of the Civil Code, which states that a debtor incurs liability for delay from the due date (or upon demand for indefinite obligations). The consequences of the creditor's delay in acceptance (e.g., interest accrual) are governed by **Article 493**, which allows tender of performance even if the creditor refuses acceptance, and **Article 494**, which permits deposit of the subject matter when the creditor refuses or cannot accept performance.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["412", "493", "494"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["412", "493", "494"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 9, "tool_calls": 8, "tokens_in": 17774, "tokens_out": 513, "tokens": 18287, "latency_s": 37.21539071799998, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 885, "out": 53, "ms": 3698.676088999491}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1252, "out": 41, "ms": 2886.562227000468}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1449, "out": 56, "ms": 3277.558093001062}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1811, "out": 41, "ms": 3122.7509540003666}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2015, "out": 57, "ms": 3456.4450010002474}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2378, "out": 41, "ms": 2479.4242209991353}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2539, "out": 59, "ms": 4697.0621360014775}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2898, "out": 41, "ms": 3297.3895680006535}, {"node": "react.force", "in": 2547, "out": 124, "ms": 10281.897709999612}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受領遅滞", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "478"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受領遅滞 債務者", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "412"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受領遅滞 債権者", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "493"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受領遅滞 債権者 利息", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "494"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev006-ja", "item_id": "dev006", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["160-3"], "anchor": ["160-2"], "answer": "健康保険法で「子ども・子育て支援金率」を定めているのは第百六十条の二です。その直後の条文は**第百六十条の三**です。\n\n**第百六十条の三（準備金）**：保険者は、健康保険事業の費用支出に備えるため、毎事業年度末に準備金を積み立てなければならない。また、収支の見通しから事業運営に支障が生じる恐れがある場合は、厚生労働大臣に報告し、必要な措置を講じる必要がある。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["160-2", "160-3"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 5455, "tokens_out": 255, "tokens": 5710, "latency_s": 19.447618015001353, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 897, "out": 56, "ms": 3107.0953710004687}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1293, "out": 44, "ms": 3332.9298199987534}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1515, "out": 44, "ms": 2507.074366998495}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1750, "out": 111, "ms": 10494.431316999908}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "子ども・子育て支援金率", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-2"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-3"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev006-en", "item_id": "dev006", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["160-3"], "anchor": ["160-2"], "answer": "The article immediately after the one on「子ども・子育て支援金率」(Article 160-2) is **Article 160-3 of the Health Insurance Act**.\n\nIt provides that insurers must establish a **reserve fund** at the end of each fiscal year to prepare for expenses related to health insurance operations, following regulations set by government ordinance.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["160-2", "160-3"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 5435, "tokens_out": 220, "tokens": 5655, "latency_s": 15.80030724000062, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 892, "out": 56, "ms": 4427.52473100154}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1288, "out": 44, "ms": 3135.63829099985}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1510, "out": 44, "ms": 2588.8052729987976}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1745, "out": 76, "ms": 5642.168132999359}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "子ども・子育て支援金率", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-2"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-3"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev007-ja", "item_id": "dev007", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "刑法", "gold": ["70"], "anchor": ["69"], "answer": "「法律上の減軽と刑の選択」を定めているのは刑法第69条です。この条文の直後にあるのは**刑法第70条**です。\n\n**刑法第70条**の内容は要約すると以下の通りです。\n「法律上の減軽によって、適用する刑が二個以上ある場合、その中から最も軽い刑を選び、さらに減軽すべき事由がある場合は、その事由に従って減軽する。」", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["69", "70"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 2}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2115, "tokens_out": 153, "tokens": 2268, "latency_s": 10.745477036000011, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 897, "out": 56, "ms": 4592.376520000471}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1218, "out": 97, "ms": 6149.294507999002}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "法律上の減軽と刑の選択", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev007-en", "item_id": "dev007", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "刑法", "gold": ["70"], "anchor": ["69"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 69 is **Article 70** of the Penal Code. It provides that when reducing a term of imprisonment or detention results in a remainder of less than one day, that remainder shall be discarded.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["69", "70"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3476, "tokens_out": 179, "tokens": 3655, "latency_s": 13.73140742799842, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 56, "ms": 3862.830344000031}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1214, "out": 75, "ms": 5205.954707000274}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1369, "out": 48, "ms": 4657.828185998369}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "法律上の減軽と刑の選択", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "刑法", "article": "70"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev008-ja", "item_id": "dev008", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["40"], "anchor": ["39"], "answer": "健康保険法で「資格の得喪の確認」を定めているのは第39条です。その直後の条文は**第40条**です。\n\n**第40条の内容要約**: 被保険者の標準報酬月額を、その報酬月額に基づき等級区分によって定めることを規定しています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["39", "40"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 6474, "tokens_out": 205, "tokens": 6679, "latency_s": 15.29745765700136, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 896, "out": 56, "ms": 3995.3273640003317}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1269, "out": 41, "ms": 3417.942508000124}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1581, "out": 41, "ms": 2636.312022999846}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2728, "out": 67, "ms": 5241.2645849999535}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "資格の得喪の確認", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "39"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "40"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev008-en", "item_id": "dev008", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["40"], "anchor": ["39"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 39 (資格の得喪の確認) in the Health Insurance Act is **Article 40 (標準報酬月額)**.\n\nArticle 40 establishes the standard remuneration monthly amount (標準報酬月額) based on the insured person's remuneration monthly amount, defining the classification levels and corresponding amounts used for calculating insurance benefits.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["39", "40"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 6454, "tokens_out": 210, "tokens": 6664, "latency_s": 18.67527963199973, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 891, "out": 55, "ms": 4317.851196001357}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1264, "out": 41, "ms": 3826.297188999888}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1576, "out": 41, "ms": 4065.6654840004194}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2723, "out": 73, "ms": 6458.460562000255}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "資格の得喪の確認", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "39"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "40"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev009-ja", "item_id": "dev009", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["23-2"], "anchor": ["23"], "answer": "「譲受会社による債務の引受け」を定めているのは会社法第23条です。その直後の条文は第23条の2（id 23-2）です。\n\n**第23条の2**\n事業譲渡で債権者を害する旨を知って行った場合、譲受会社は承継した財産の価額を限度として、債務の履行を請求される責任を負う（ただし、債権者を害することを知らなかった場合は例外）。また、この責任は譲渡会社の悪意を知った時から2年以内、または事業譲渡から10年以内の請求に限定される。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["23", "23-2"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 3875, "tokens_out": 279, "tokens": 4154, "latency_s": 21.38557672100069, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 1}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 898, "out": 57, "ms": 4638.963028999569}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1276, "out": 84, "ms": 7901.1370340012945}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1701, "out": 138, "ms": 8837.276783999187}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "譲受会社による債務の引受け", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "23-2"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "23-3"}, "ok": false}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev009-en", "item_id": "dev009", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["23-2"], "anchor": ["23"], "answer": "The article immediately after 第二十三条の二 (Article 23-2) on 「譲受会社による債務の引受け」 is **第二十三条の三 (Article 23-3)**.\n\nIt provides that if a transferor company has transferred its business to a transferee company and the transferee company has assumed the debts, the transferee company may request the transferor company to perform the debts that were not assumed by the transferee company.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["23-2", "23-3"], "invalid": ["23-3"], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3797, "tokens_out": 194, "tokens": 3991, "latency_s": 15.109984360999078, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 57, "ms": 4337.854503000926}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1271, "out": 42, "ms": 3492.0925999995234}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1633, "out": 95, "ms": 7273.9259580012}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "譲受会社による債務の引受け", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "23-2"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev010-ja", "item_id": "dev010", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["485"], "anchor": ["484"], "answer": "「弁済の場所及び時間」を定めているのは民法第484条です。この条文の直後にあるのは第485条です。\n\n**第485条の内容要約**：\n弁済の費用について別段の意思表示がないときは、その費用は債務者の負担となります。ただし、債権者が住所の移転その他の行為によって弁済の費用を増加させた場合は、その増加分は債権者の負担となります。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["484", "485"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2146, "tokens_out": 153, "tokens": 2299, "latency_s": 11.364511617999597, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 895, "out": 54, "ms": 3780.331597999975}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1251, "out": 99, "ms": 7580.050372998812}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "弁済の場所及び時間", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev010-en", "item_id": "dev010", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["485"], "anchor": ["484"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 484 (弁済の場所及び時間) is **Article 485** of the Civil Code.\n\nIt provides that unless otherwise agreed, the costs of performance shall be borne by the debtor, except when the creditor has increased the costs by moving their residence or other acts.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["484", "485"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3564, "tokens_out": 162, "tokens": 3726, "latency_s": 12.267637678000028, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 891, "out": 55, "ms": 3724.0167210002255}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1248, "out": 41, "ms": 2416.71353700076}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1425, "out": 66, "ms": 6121.531001999756}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "弁済の場所及び時間", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "484"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev011-ja", "item_id": "dev011", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["97"], "anchor": ["96"], "answer": "「詐欺又は強迫」を直接含む条文は、民法第96条（詐欺又は強迫による意思表示の取消し）と第747条（詐欺又は強迫による婚姻の取消し）です。\n\nそれぞれの直後の条文は以下の通りです。\n\n1.  **第96条の直後**: **第97条**\n    *   **内容**: 詐欺又は強迫による取消権の行使期間（1年）と、その期間の起算点（詐欺を発見した時など）を定めています。\n2.  **第747条の直後**: **第748条**\n    *   **内容**: 詐欺又は強迫による婚姻の取消権の行使期間（1年）と、その期間の起算点（詐欺を発見した時など）を定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["96", "747", "97", "748"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["747", "748"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2136, "tokens_out": 236, "tokens": 2372, "latency_s": 15.932923608999772, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 52, "ms": 4531.425664999915}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1243, "out": 184, "ms": 11397.2235429992}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "詐欺又は強迫", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev011-en", "item_id": "dev011", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["97"], "anchor": ["96"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 747 is **Article 748** (婚姻の取消しの効力). It provides that the effect of annulling a marriage is retroactive only for the future. It also stipulates that a party who acquired property through the marriage without knowing the cause for annulment must return the property to the extent of their current benefit, while a party who knew the cause must return all benefits and may be liable for damages if the other party acted in good faith.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["747", "748"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["747", "748"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3594, "tokens_out": 219, "tokens": 3813, "latency_s": 14.20817482199891, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 889, "out": 52, "ms": 3025.4304750014853}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1239, "out": 64, "ms": 4091.0460439990857}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1466, "out": 103, "ms": 7086.419805000332}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "詐欺又は強迫", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "748"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev012-ja", "item_id": "dev012", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["870", "1015"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法における「後見の計算」と「遺言執行者の行為の効果」を定めた条文は以下の通りです。\n\n1. **後見の計算**\n   - **民法 872条**：後見人が管理する財産の計算方法（貸借の清算）を定めています。\n\n2. **遺言執行者の行為の効果**\n   - **民法 1000条**：遺言執行者が遺言に従って行った行為の効力を定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["872", "1000"], "invalid": ["1000"], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["872"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 895, "tokens_out": 106, "tokens": 1001, "latency_s": 6.143638276000274, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 895, "out": 106, "ms": 6141.729826000301}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev012-en", "item_id": "dev012", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["870", "1015"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**「後見の計算」に関する条文:**\n*   **民法第870条**: 後見人の任務終了後、後見人等は2ヶ月以内に後見の計算をしなければならない。\n*   **民法第871条**: 後見の計算は、後見監督人がいる場合はその立会いのもとに行わなければならない。\n*   **民法第872条**: 未成年被後見人が成年に達した後、計算終了前にされた契約は、その者が取り消せる。\n*   **民法第873条**: 後見の計算終了時から利息を付さなければならない。\n*   **民法第966条**: 後見の計算終了前に、被後見人が後見人等の利益となる遺言をした場合は無効。\n\n**「遺言執行者の行為の効果」に関する条文:**\n*   **民法第1012条**: 遺言執行者は遺言実現のため必要な行為をする権利義務を有する。\n*   **民法第1015条**: 遺言執行者が権限内で行った行為は、相続人に対して直接効力を生ずる。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["870", "871", "872", "873", "966", "1012", "1015"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["871", "872", "873", "966", "1012"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 2496, "tokens_out": 355, "tokens": 2851, "latency_s": 21.768371393000052, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 894, "out": 106, "ms": 6800.974538000446}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1602, "out": 249, "ms": 14962.2853510009}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "後見の計算", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "遺言執行者の行為の効果", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev013-ja", "item_id": "dev013", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["189", "167"], "anchor": [], "answer": "健康保険法で「審査請求及び再審査請求」を定めているのは**第189条**です。被保険者の資格、標準報酬、保険給付に関する処分に不服がある場合、社会保険審査官への審査請求と、その決定に不服がある場合の社会保険審査会への再審査請求を認めています。\n\n「保険料の源泉控除」については**第167条**です。事業主は、被保険者に通貨で報酬や賞与を支払う際、被保険者の負担すべき保険料を報酬や賞与から控除でき、控除した場合は計算書を作成し、被保険者に通知する義務があります。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["189", "167"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 5, "tokens_in": 4810, "tokens_out": 381, "tokens": 5191, "latency_s": 22.65016249600012, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 899, "out": 112, "ms": 7744.171203001315}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1646, "out": 126, "ms": 6904.940505999548}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2265, "out": 143, "ms": 7995.389454999895}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "審査請求 再審査請求", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "保険料 源泉控除", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "189"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "190"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "167"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev013-en", "item_id": "dev013", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["189", "167"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**健康保険法 第百八十九条**: 被保険者の資格、標準報酬、保険給付に関する処分に不服がある者は、社会保険審査官に審査請求し、その決定に不服がある場合は社会保険審査会に再審査請求できる。\n\n**健康保険法 第百九十条**: 保険料等の賦課・徴収処分や第百八十条の処分に不服がある者は、社会保険審査会に審査請求できる。\n\n**健康保険法 第百六十七条**: 事業主は、被保険者に報酬や賞与を支払う際、その被保険者が負担すべき保険料を報酬から控除できる。控除した場合は計算書を作成し、被保険者に通知しなければならない。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["189", "190", "180", "167"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["190", "180"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 6, "tokens_in": 4932, "tokens_out": 435, "tokens": 5367, "latency_s": 27.73634621599922, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 897, "out": 112, "ms": 6791.644581000583}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1638, "out": 168, "ms": 10122.190019999834}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2397, "out": 155, "ms": 10815.768317999755}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "審査請求及び再審査請求", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "保険料の源泉控除", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "189"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "190"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "191"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "167"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev014-ja", "item_id": "dev014", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "刑法", "gold": ["263", "20"], "anchor": [], "answer": "刑法における「信書隠匿」は**第二百六十三条**、「没収の制限」は**第四十九条**です。\n\n*   **第二百六十三条（信書隠匿罪）**：他人の信書を隠匿した者は、六月以下の拘禁刑又は十万円以下の罰金若しくは科料に処する。\n*   **第四十九条（没収の制限）**：併合罪のうちの重い罪について没収を科さない場合であっても、他の罪について没収の事由があるときは、これを付加することができる。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["263", "49"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.5, "extra": ["49"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 2237, "tokens_out": 219, "tokens": 2456, "latency_s": 13.181156201999329, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 893, "out": 104, "ms": 6668.515261999346}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1344, "out": 115, "ms": 6508.9925229985965}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "信書隠匿", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 3}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "没収の制限", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 3}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev014-en", "item_id": "dev014", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "刑法", "gold": ["263", "20"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**信書隠匿**:\n- **刑法 第263条**: 他人の信書を隠匿した者は、六月以下の拘禁刑又は十万円以下の罰金若しくは科料に処する。\n\n**没収の制限**:\n- **刑法 第20条**: 拘留又は科料のみに当たる罪については、特別の規定がなければ、没収を科することができない。\n- **刑法 第46条**: 併合罪のうちの一個の罪について死刑に処するときは、他の刑を科さない。ただし、没収は、この限りでない。\n- **刑法 第49条**: 併合罪のうちの重い罪について没収を科さない場合であっても、他の罪について没収の事由があるときは、これを付加することができる。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["263", "20", "46", "49"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["46", "49"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 2470, "tokens_out": 275, "tokens": 2745, "latency_s": 17.538704413000232, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 892, "out": 104, "ms": 7549.396173999412}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1578, "out": 171, "ms": 9985.171409000031}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "信書隠匿", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "没収の制限", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev015-ja", "item_id": "dev015", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["950", "774-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "「業務の休廃止」については、検索結果で「電子公告調査の業務」に関する条文（第950条など）がヒットしましたが、一般的な会社の「業務の休廃止」を定めた条文は見つかりませんでした。会社法には、特定の調査機関の業務休止に関する規定はありますが、一般会社の業務休止を直接規定する条文は存在しないようです。\n\n「株式交付子会社の株式の譲渡しに関する規定の準用」については、第774条の6が該当します。\n\n**第774条の6**\n株式交付親会社が株式交付に際して譲り受ける株式交付子会社の株式の総数の譲渡しについては、第774条の4（株式交付子会社の株式の譲渡人）および第774条の5（株式交付子会社の株式の割当て）の規定を準用します。\n\n「業務の休廃止」に関する一般的な規定は会社法に存在しないため、該当する条文を挙げることはできません。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["950", "774-6", "774-4", "774-5"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.5, "extra": ["774-6", "774-4", "774-5"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 5, "quotes_unsupported": 4}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 2557, "tokens_out": 332, "tokens": 2889, "latency_s": 20.365535320999697, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 904, "out": 116, "ms": 7041.4351420004095}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1653, "out": 216, "ms": 13316.833438000685}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "業務の休廃止", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "株式交付子会社の株式の譲渡しに関する規定の準用", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev015-en", "item_id": "dev015", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["950", "774-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "「業務の休廃止」は、会社法第九百五十七条（電子公告調査の業務の実施）で、法務大臣が業務を休止・廃止する届出があった場合などに自ら業務を行う規定です。「株式交付子会社の株式の譲渡しに関する規定の準用」は、会社法第七百七十四条の六で、株式交付子会社の株式を譲渡しようとする者が株式交付親会社が譲り受ける株式の総数の譲渡しを行う契約を締結する場合は、前二条（第七百七十四条の四・五）の規定を適用しないとする準用の規定です。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["957", "774-6", "774-4"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["957", "774-6", "774-4"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 2}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 4, "tokens_in": 4685, "tokens_out": 331, "tokens": 5016, "latency_s": 22.413301525999486, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 902, "out": 116, "ms": 8533.846385998913}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1651, "out": 84, "ms": 5639.358604001245}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2132, "out": 131, "ms": 8229.964782000025}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "業務の休廃止", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "株式交付子会社の株式の譲渡しに関する規定の準用", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "957"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "774-6"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev016-ja", "item_id": "dev016", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["914", "468"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法における該当する条文は以下の通りです。\n\n1. **遺言による担保責任の定め**\n   **民法 第962条**\n   遺言で、遺贈を受けた者が遺言執行者に対して担保責任を負うことを定めた場合、その責任の範囲や方法について定めます。\n\n2. **債権の譲渡における債務者の抗弁**\n   **民法 第467条**\n   債権を譲渡した際、債務者は、譲受人に対して、譲渡人（元の債権者）が債務者に対して持っていた抗弁（権利を主張できること）を主張できます。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["962", "467"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["962", "467"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 902, "tokens_out": 141, "tokens": 1043, "latency_s": 8.46191525300128, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 902, "out": 141, "ms": 8460.021996999785}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev016-en", "item_id": "dev016", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["914", "468"], "anchor": [], "answer": "There is no article in the Civil Code explicitly titled「遺言による担保責任の定め」. The term may be a misunderstanding; Article 1016 concerns the executor's authority to delegate duties, not a security obligation by will.\n\nFor「債権の譲渡における債務者の抗弁」, the relevant articles are:\n\n- **Article 467**: An assignment of claims is ineffective against the debtor or third parties unless the assignor notifies the debtor or the debtor consents.\n- **Article 469**: The debtor may offset claims against the assignee if those claims existed before notification/consent, or arose from the same contract as the assigned claim.\n\nThese articles govern the debtor's defenses in claim assignments.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["1016", "467", "469"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["1016", "467", "469"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 2}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 5, "tokens_in": 4931, "tokens_out": 494, "tokens": 5425, "latency_s": 30.20616449100089, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 901, "out": 115, "ms": 6758.229050999944}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1630, "out": 224, "ms": 13508.444094999504}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2400, "out": 155, "ms": 9930.616420999286}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "遺言による担保責任の定め", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "債権の譲渡における債務者の抗弁", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "1016"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "467"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "469"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev017-ja", "item_id": "dev017", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["805", "400"], "anchor": [], "answer": "会社法における「新設分割計画の承認を要しない場合」と「委員の選定等」に関する条文は以下の通りです。\n\n1. **新設分割計画の承認を要しない場合**\n   - **会社法第463条**：新設分割計画が、分割する会社と新設する会社の株主総会に提出されることなく、これらの会社の取締役会が承認し、かつ、その旨を公告した場合は、その計画は承認されたものとみなされる。\n\n2. **委員の選定等**\n   - **会社法第464条**：新設分割を行う会社は、分割計画の策定に当たり、独立した第三者からなる委員会を選任しなければならない。この委員会は、分割計画の策定に関し必要な事項を調査し、意見を述べなければならない。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["463", "464"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["463", "464"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 2}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 901, "tokens_out": 176, "tokens": 1077, "latency_s": 10.826967519999016, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 901, "out": 176, "ms": 10825.029900001027}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev017-en", "item_id": "dev017", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["805", "400"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**「新設分割計画の承認を要しない場合」**については、会社法第764条が該当します。同条は、新設分割設立株式会社が成立の日に権利義務を承継する旨を定めており、第808条の債権者保護規定の例外（承認不要な場合）を扱います。\n\n**「委員の選定等」**については、会社法第400条が該当します。同条は、指名委員会、監査委員会、報酬委員会の委員が取締役の中から取締役会の決議で選定されることを定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["764", "808", "400"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.5, "extra": ["764", "808"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 2}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 6, "tokens_in": 5887, "tokens_out": 403, "tokens": 6290, "latency_s": 27.084210941999117, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 899, "out": 113, "ms": 7142.841214999862}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1617, "out": 164, "ms": 11678.345231001003}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 3371, "out": 126, "ms": 8254.52026899984}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "新設分割計画の承認を要しない場合", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "委員の選定等", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "764"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "808"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "400"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "401"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
